{"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/path\/addarc(center:radius:startangle:endangle:clockwise:transform:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"addArc","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"center","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Point3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"radius","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AffineTransform3D","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV"},{"text":" = .identity)","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The center of the arc, in user space coordinates.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"center"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The radius of the arc, in user space coordinates."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"radius"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The angle to the starting point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"startAngle"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The angle to the end point of the arc, measured from the positive x-axis.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"endAngle"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"True to make a clockwise arc; false to make a counterclockwise arc."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"clockwise"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An affine transform to apply to the arc before adding to the path. Defaults to the identity transform if not specified."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"transform"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method calculates starting and ending points using the radius and angles you specify, uses a sequence of cubic Bézier curves to approximate a segment of a circle between those points, and then appends those curves to the path."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clockwise parameter determines the direction in which the arc is created; the actual direction of the final path is dependent on the transform parameter and the current transform of a context where the path is drawn."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, because OpenSwiftUI by default uses a vertically-flipped coordinate system (with the origin in the top-left of the view), specifying a clockwise arc results in a counterclockwise arc after the transformation is applied."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the path ends with an unclosed subpath, this method adds a line connecting the current point to the starting point of the arc."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If there is no unclosed subpath, this method creates a new subpath whose starting point is the starting point of the arc."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The ending point of the arc becomes the new current point of the path."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Path\/addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","title":"addArc(center:radius:startAngle:endAngle:clockwise:transform:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4PathV6addArc6center6radius10startAngle03endJ09clockwise9transformy0A7Spatial7Point3DV_SdAK7Angle2DVAOSbAK17AffineTransform3DVtF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"addArc"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"center"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Point3DV","text":"Point3D"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"radius"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"startAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"endAngle","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Angle2D","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial7Angle2DV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"clockwise","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AffineTransform3D","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSpatial17AffineTransform3DV","kind":"typeIdentifi